= Advanced Key Exchange Protocols

This section covers advanced protocols that go beyond basic key establishment. We examine the three-pass Massey-Omura protocol and strictly defined standards for authenticated key agreement like MQV, exploring how underlying mathematical representations (bases) affect their implementation and performance.

